{
  "source": "Prompts/where-ai-works-best-v10.mp4",
  "duration": 173.8026875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.68,
      "text": "AI will take on almost anything you ask."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.26,
      "end": 8.32,
      "text": "You can ask it to brainstorm angles for an essay, plan a schedule, build code, or draw an image."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.08,
      "end": 13.88,
      "text": "But what an AI can try to do is entirely different from what it is actually built for."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.68,
      "end": 16.32,
      "text": "We saw this first hand building this course."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.86,
      "end": 20.34,
      "text": "AI successfully wrote the code for every page, earning an A+."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.86,
      "end": 25.14,
      "text": "But on the right side, when asked to draft actual lessons, it scored a C-minus."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.14,
      "end": 30.66,
      "text": "The explanations missed our intent, arranged points in the wrong order, and lacked a logical flow."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.48,
      "end": 35.54,
      "text": "The AI was excellent at testing whether a button worked or a page loaded correctly."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.24,
      "end": 41.5,
      "text": "But when a lesson required the right ideas presented in a way that made sense, the drafts weren't good enough to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.12,
      "end": 45.96,
      "text": "We still had to rely on our own judgment to decide what worked and what needed to change."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.84,
      "end": 49.6,
      "text": "Same AI, different jobs, different results."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.34,
      "end": 56.82,
      "text": "To get the best out of this tool, you need to recognize the four specific shapes of work it is actually strongest at handling."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.9,
      "end": 59.88,
      "text": "The first strength is reshape your material."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.56,
      "end": 66.48,
      "text": "Just provide something you already have and ask the AI to return it in a different format, preserving your original meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.22,
      "end": 71.3,
      "text": "For example, take messy notes and have AI organize them into a clean study guide."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.1,
      "end": 74.66,
      "text": "Turn a scattered voice memo into a strict to-do list."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.46,
      "end": 77.36,
      "text": "The second strength is explore possibilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.36,
      "end": 80.82,
      "text": "When stuck, ask the AI for several approaches."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.46,
      "end": 87.2,
      "text": "You react to its suggestions, ask for variations, and decide which specific ideas are worth taking further."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.82,
      "end": 92.72,
      "text": "You might ask it to brainstorm distinct angles for an essay, or come up with ideas for a fundraiser."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.26,
      "end": 96.28,
      "text": "The third strength is find what matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.9,
      "end": 102.8,
      "text": "Supply the AI with long documents, and it will summarize core ideas or pull out the exact data points you requested."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.8,
      "end": 106.18,
      "text": "Locate specific requirements hidden in a scholarship application."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.02,
      "end": 109.22,
      "text": "Compare arguments made by two different articles."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 112.46,
      "text": "The fourth and final strength is work through problems."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.18,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "Tell AI what you're trying to accomplish, what you know, and what's in your way."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.66,
      "end": 121.28,
      "text": "It breaks the problem into manageable steps and compares possible approaches."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.96,
      "end": 123.82,
      "text": "Figure out an unexpected experiment result."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.56,
      "end": 126.06,
      "text": "Use this to plan a trip on a budget."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.62,
      "end": 129.44,
      "text": "AI organizes the logic but doesn't make the final choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.21,
      "end": 134.7,
      "text": "All four of these strengths exist because of one underlying factor, vast exposure."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.64,
      "end": 139.78,
      "text": "Training gave the AI exposure to more examples than any human could read in a lifetime."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.56,
      "end": 144.82,
      "text": "It ingested code, essays, explanations, emails, arguments, and conversations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.56,
      "end": 148.06,
      "text": "making it highly fluent in common human formats."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.82,
      "end": 152.96,
      "text": "This massive exposure makes the AI extremely good at getting a task started,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.42,
      "end": 156.82,
      "text": "but it doesn't guarantee the answer is right or that it fits what you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.82,
      "end": 161.2,
      "text": "Because the system is ultimately predictive, you must apply your own judgment"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.2,
      "end": 163.56,
      "text": "to evaluate the final context and accuracy."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.78,
      "end": 166.5,
      "text": "AI does some things better than others."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.22,
      "end": 168.88,
      "text": "Can try is not built for."
    }
  ],
